---
import NoteFigure from './NoteFigure.astro';
// Deterministic illustrative points, transformed by the stated analytic bijection.
const points = [
  [-1.35, -0.55], [-1.25, 0.35], [-0.95, 1.1], [-0.8, -1.15],
  [-0.65, -0.25], [-0.55, 0.65], [-0.25, -0.85], [-0.2, 0.15],
  [0.05, 1.2], [0.15, -0.3], [0.35, 0.55], [0.5, -1.05],
  [0.65, -0.05], [0.85, 0.95], [1.05, -0.6], [1.3, 0.25],
];
const coordinates = (z1: number, z2: number) => ({ x: 150 + 48 * z1, y: 157 - 48 * z2 });
---

<NoteFigure
  label="Invertible flow"
  title="Sample forward, evaluate density backward"
  caption="Reconstructed from the two-way maps and composition on pages 31–33. The dots are illustrative, with corresponding points related by the exact toy bijection f(z₁,z₂) = (z₁, z₂ + 0.55z₁²); its inverse subtracts 0.55x₁². They are not a fitted distribution or measured samples. The lower chain is a schematic general flow: generation follows f₁ through fK, while density evaluation follows the inverses in reverse order."
>
  <div class="direction-panels">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 300 295" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-base-title flow-base-desc">
      <title id="flow-base-title">A simple base distribution in z space</title>
      <desc id="flow-base-desc">Sixteen illustrative points surround the origin in two dimensions. A flow begins with a known base density pZ, often a standard normal distribution; these plotted dots illustrate locations, not a measured sample cloud.</desc>
      <text x="150" y="25" text-anchor="middle" class="panel-title">Base space Z</text>
      <text x="150" y="49" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Known density pZ(z)</text>
      <path d="M 37 157 H 263 M 150 70 V 243" class="axis" />
      <text x="267" y="176" class="muted">z₁</text><text x="161" y="74" class="muted">z₂</text>
      {points.map(([z1, z2]) => { const point = coordinates(z1, z2); return <circle cx={point.x} cy={point.y} r="4" class="base-point" />; })}
      <text x="150" y="272" text-anchor="middle">Choose, for example, N(0, I)</text>
    </svg>

    <div class="direction-arrows">
      <svg class="arrows-wide" viewBox="0 0 220 295" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-arrows-wide-title flow-arrows-wide-desc">
        <title id="flow-arrows-wide-title">Generation and density evaluation use opposite directions</title>
        <desc id="flow-arrows-wide-desc">Generation sends z to x using f. Density evaluation sends observed x back to z using g equals the inverse of f, then adds the log absolute determinant of the inverse Jacobian to the base log density.</desc>
        <defs><marker id="flow-arrows-wide-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="arrow-head" /></marker></defs>
        <text x="110" y="87" text-anchor="middle" class="accent">Generation</text>
        <path d="M 12 111 H 208" class="forward" marker-end="url(#flow-arrows-wide-head)" />
        <text x="110" y="138" text-anchor="middle">x = f(z)</text>
        <text x="110" y="182" text-anchor="middle" class="accent">Density evaluation</text>
        <path d="M 208 205 H 12" class="forward" marker-end="url(#flow-arrows-wide-head)" />
        <text x="110" y="231" text-anchor="middle">z = g(x) = f⁻¹(x)</text>
        <text x="110" y="260" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Add log |det Jg(x)|</text>
      </svg>
      <svg class="arrows-narrow" viewBox="0 0 300 180" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-arrows-narrow-title flow-arrows-narrow-desc">
        <title id="flow-arrows-narrow-title">Vertical forward and inverse paths</title>
        <desc id="flow-arrows-narrow-desc">The left downward arrow is generation, x equals f of z. The right upward arrow is inverse density evaluation, z equals g of x; the density formula adds the inverse log absolute Jacobian determinant.</desc>
        <defs><marker id="flow-arrows-narrow-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="arrow-head" /></marker></defs>
        <path d="M 50 14 V 137 M 249 137 V 14" class="forward" marker-end="url(#flow-arrows-narrow-head)" />
        <text x="68" y="38" class="accent">Generate</text><text x="68" y="62">x = f(z)</text>
        <text x="230" y="111" text-anchor="end" class="accent">Evaluate density</text><text x="230" y="136" text-anchor="end">z = g(x) = f⁻¹(x)</text>
        <text x="150" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Add log |det Jg(x)| to log pZ(g(x))</text>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <svg viewBox="0 0 300 295" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-data-title flow-data-desc">
      <title id="flow-data-title">The same points after an invertible shear</title>
      <desc id="flow-data-desc">Each point keeps its first coordinate and gains zero point five five times the square of its first coordinate in its second coordinate. This makes a curved cloud through a bijective toy transformation, with a unique inverse for every point.</desc>
      <text x="150" y="25" text-anchor="middle" class="panel-title">Data space X</text>
      <text x="150" y="49" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Induced density pX(x)</text>
      <path d="M 37 157 H 263 M 150 70 V 243" class="axis" />
      <text x="267" y="176" class="muted">x₁</text><text x="161" y="74" class="muted">x₂</text>
      {points.map(([z1, z2]) => { const point = coordinates(z1, z2 + 0.55 * z1 ** 2); return <circle cx={point.x} cy={point.y} r="4" class="data-point" />; })}
      <text x="150" y="272" text-anchor="middle">One inverse for every point</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="composition">
    <svg class="chain-wide" viewBox="0 0 820 175" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-chain-wide-title flow-chain-wide-desc">
      <title id="flow-chain-wide-title">Compose invertible layers and reverse their order for the inverse</title>
      <desc id="flow-chain-wide-desc">Forward generation proceeds from z through f1, f2, further layers, then fK to x. The inverse proceeds from x through the inverse of fK, then through earlier inverse layers, to the inverse of f1 and z.</desc>
      <defs><marker id="flow-chain-wide-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="arrow-head" /></marker></defs>
      <text x="410" y="28" text-anchor="middle" class="panel-title">Build f from invertible layers</text>
      <g class="node"><rect x="120" y="59" width="98" height="49" rx="3" /><rect x="278" y="59" width="98" height="49" rx="3" /><rect x="602" y="59" width="98" height="49" rx="3" /></g>
      <g text-anchor="middle"><text x="39" y="90" class="symbol">z</text><text x="169" y="91">f₁</text><text x="327" y="91">f₂</text><text x="487" y="91">···</text><text x="651" y="91">fK</text><text x="781" y="90" class="symbol">x</text></g>
      <g class="forward" marker-end="url(#flow-chain-wide-head)"><path d="M 63 83 H 113" /><path d="M 225 83 H 271" /><path d="M 383 83 H 451" /><path d="M 523 83 H 595" /><path d="M 707 83 H 754" /></g>
      <path d="M 781 112 V 139 H 39 V 112" class="inverse" marker-end="url(#flow-chain-wide-head)" />
      <text x="410" y="165" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Reverse order: fK⁻¹, …, f₂⁻¹, f₁⁻¹</text>
    </svg>
    <svg class="chain-narrow" viewBox="0 0 300 390" role="img" aria-labelledby="flow-chain-narrow-title flow-chain-narrow-desc">
      <title id="flow-chain-narrow-title">A vertical chain of invertible layers</title>
      <desc id="flow-chain-narrow-desc">Generation follows z downward through f1, f2, intermediate layers, and fK to x. A return arrow runs upward and is labelled with the inverse layers in reverse order.</desc>
      <defs><marker id="flow-chain-narrow-head" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M 1 1 L 8 5 L 1 9" class="arrow-head" /></marker></defs>
      <text x="150" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="panel-title">Compose invertible layers</text>
      <g class="node"><rect x="62" y="81" width="100" height="42" rx="3" /><rect x="62" y="155" width="100" height="42" rx="3" /><rect x="62" y="276" width="100" height="42" rx="3" /></g>
      <g text-anchor="middle"><text x="112" y="62" class="symbol">z</text><text x="112" y="108">f₁</text><text x="112" y="182">f₂</text><text x="112" y="240">···</text><text x="112" y="303">fK</text><text x="112" y="375" class="symbol">x</text></g>
      <g class="forward" marker-end="url(#flow-chain-narrow-head)"><path d="M 112 65 V 75" /><path d="M 112 129 V 149" /><path d="M 112 203 V 220" /><path d="M 112 245 V 270" /><path d="M 112 324 V 348" /></g>
      <path d="M 139 365 H 277 V 56 H 139" class="inverse" marker-end="url(#flow-chain-narrow-head)" />
      <text x="223" y="139" text-anchor="middle" class="accent">Inverse:</text><text x="223" y="164" text-anchor="middle">fK⁻¹</text><text x="223" y="191" text-anchor="middle">···</text><text x="223" y="218" text-anchor="middle">f₂⁻¹</text><text x="223" y="245" text-anchor="middle">f₁⁻¹</text>
      <text x="223" y="286" text-anchor="middle" class="muted">Reverse order</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</NoteFigure>

<style>
  .direction-panels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .75fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: .25rem; }
  svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  text { fill: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 16px; }
  .panel-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; }
  .muted { fill: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  .accent { fill: var(--accent); }
  .symbol { font-size: 24px; font-style: italic; }
  .axis { fill: none; stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; }
  .base-point { fill: var(--ink); }
  .data-point { fill: var(--accent); }
  .forward, .arrow-head { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .inverse { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .node { fill: var(--paper); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .composition { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: .6rem; padding-top: .6rem; }
  .arrows-narrow, .chain-narrow { display: none; }
  @container (max-width: 580px) {
    .direction-panels { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .direction-panels > svg { max-width: 340px; margin-inline: auto; }
    .direction-arrows { width: 100%; max-width: 340px; margin-inline: auto; }
    .arrows-wide, .chain-wide { display: none; }
    .arrows-narrow, .chain-narrow { display: block; }
    .chain-narrow { max-width: 340px; margin-inline: auto; }
  }
</style>
